@startuml vault-backed-byte-accounting
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName "sans-serif"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37474F
  LifeLineBorderColor #455A64
  ParticipantBorderColor #37474F
  ParticipantFontColor #102027
}
title Vault-backed byte accounting: staged located funding, exact settlement, deterministic replay

actor "Authorized wallet\ntransaction" as Wallet #C8E6C9
participant "SystemVault\nsponsor purse" as Sponsor #BBDEFB
participant "Lollipop contract\nretained capability" as Contract #D1C4E9
participant "SystemVault\nouter + continuation purses" as Located #90CAF9
participant "Casper admission\npre-state snapshot" as Admission #FFE082
actor "Authenticated\ngateway" as Gateway #C5E1A5
participant "Rholang + RSpace\naccounting observer" as Runtime #FFCCBC
participant "Atomic applyCost\nsettlement" as Settlement #CE93D8
participant "Independent\nvalidator replay" as Replay #B2DFDB

Wallet -> Sponsor : credit unreserved REV
Contract --> Wallet : publish distinct deposit addresses\nretain unforgeable draw capability
Wallet -> Sponsor : authenticate atomic funding transfer
Sponsor -> Located : debit sponsor; credit both purses
Gateway -> Contract : authenticate continuation activation
Contract -> Runtime : activate only after funding\nand outer authority commit
Admission -> Located : authenticate each purse and located authority
Located --> Admission : fixed component-wise pre-state inventory
Admission -> Located : reserve outer + continuation bounds
Admission -> Sponsor : reserve separate gateway fee
note over Admission,Located #FFF8E1
The reservation snapshot is immutable.
A later authorized credit changes only unreserved balance.
end note

Admission -> Runtime : execute under fixed hard ceiling
Runtime -> Runtime : pin each introduction sponsor once\nwithout changing stored interaction authority
Runtime -> Runtime : committed COMM\ncharge 1 execution unit + all payload/trace bytes;\nrecord independent physical authority draw
Runtime --> Admission : exact witness + schedule digest

Wallet -> Located : concurrent authorized top-up
note right of Located #E8F5E9
The top-up is a separate conserving state transition.
It cannot enlarge the running reservation.
end note

Admission -> Settlement : certificate + exact witness
Settlement -> Located : debit each purse's realized authority + bytes\nrefund each purse's unused reserve
Settlement -> Sponsor : transfer gateway fee to its recipient
Settlement --> Admission : one atomic committed state transition

Admission -> Replay : block, certificate, witness, event trace
Replay -> Replay : recompute sponsors, canonical sizes, located allocation,\nroot chain, and schedule binding
Replay --> Admission : accept only exact equality

legend bottom
|= Color |= Meaning |
|<#C8E6C9> green | authorized conserving credit |
|<#BBDEFB> blue | native REV custody |
|<#D1C4E9> lavender | retained linear capability |
|<#90CAF9> light blue | independently funded located purses |
|<#FFE082> amber | consensus reservation |
|<#FFCCBC> orange | metered execution |
|<#CE93D8> purple | atomic settlement |
|<#B2DFDB> teal | independent replay |
endlegend
@enduml
